  "metadata": {
    "name": "nr-airport-support-county",
    "description": "PLAN.md §7.5 step 7e: the `nr-airport-support-county` RunSpec computed from the DEFAULT DATABASE -- Cook County, Illinois, August 2020, weekday, sector 8 (Airport Support), onroad diesel, CO, NOx, SO2 and PM10. NONROAD'S WHOLE INVENTORY: the diesel selection matches no nonroad fuel ID, so every SCC runs -- gasoline, diesel, LPG, CNG and marine, 1,084 equipment points, 5,267 cohorts, 21,068 rows, all reproduced at 7.207e-06.\n\nIt is `nr-industrial-county`'s computation with SO2 added: both RunSpecs select an empty packet at the same county, so the sector selects nothing, and their CO totals agree to the gram. What it adds is the SOx rewrite at the diesel technologies' alternate conversions -- 0.30 for Tier 4."
